OL,3,GNEWSACity redevelopment could include
OL,4,Amajor NHS facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new multi-million pound NHS centre
OL,7,Fcould be coming to Worcester to help
OL,8,Fease pressure on Worcestershire Royal
OL,9,FHospital.
OL,11,FWorcestershire County Council is in
OL,12,Ftalks with health bosses about opening
OL,13,Fa community diagnostic centre at Shrub
OL,14,FHill Quarter.
OL,16,FThe site would include a range of
OL,17,Fequipment including a CT scanner,
OL,18,Fultrasound, MRI scanner and X-ray suite
OL,19,Fcapable of testing for an array of
OL,20,Fillnesses.
